assets.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: transparent sprite atlas for SHIOGAERI coastal salvage indie game.
Create a genuine alpha-transparent PNG, 1536x1024, EXACTLY FOUR EQUAL COLUMNS and TWO EQUAL ROWS, eight separate subjects. Every cell is 384 pixels wide and 512 pixels tall. No grid lines. Each subject centered in its cell, complete silhouette and comfortable transparent margin; absolutely no overlapping cells, no labels.
TOP ROW from left to right:
cell 1: small coastal scavenger standing in front threequarter view, ocher hooded raincoat, dark boots, large weathered satchel and tiny warm cream lantern;
cell 2: the SAME ocher raincoat scavenger, side view walking to the RIGHT, same large satchel and tiny lantern;
cell 3: armored slate-blue crab with wide angular armored shell, readable big claws and articulated legs;
cell 4: long-legged salt-marsh bird, elegant pale weathered feathers, slate wing, long beak, long thin legs.
BOTTOM ROW left to right:
cell 5: heavy rusted old diving-suit guard, round brass diving helmet, broad slate metal shoulder plates, bulky weighty boots, substantial silhouette;
cell 6: salvage wooden chest, weathered dark wood and oxidized metal bands, lid closed;
cell 7: rusty floodgate winch, wheel and spindle mounted on a small iron pedestal, sturdy readable shape;
cell 8: a small old lighthouse, cream weathered plaster, slate cap, tiny warm light, short stone base.
Art direction all eight: handcrafted hand-painted gouache with fine etched ink outlines, subtle weathered paper texture confined INSIDE the objects. Desaturated slate/navy/teal, oxidized rust, ocher coat, warm cream light. Confident irregular edges, material texture, clear chunky focal shapes and simple high contrast silhouettes that remain readable when reduced to 40–70 pixels. Slightly top-down threequarter game view except requested walking side view. Cohesive proportions and top-left light. Subject heights fit central 75% of cells. Ocher traveler and diving guard have same approximate height, crab/chest/winch shorter naturally.
NO words, letters, logos, UI, borders, cell separators, floors, scenery, shadows extending out of cells, checkerboard background, painted background, neon, pixel art, glossy 3D. Background is empty alpha transparency, including between subjects.
